  "title": "Teriyaki Meatballs from Reynolds Wrap®",
  "description": "These turkey teriyaki meatballs from Natasha Kravchuk of Natasha&#39;s Kitchen are juicy and so flavorful with a homemade teriyaki glaze. They come together quickly making them an easy dinner idea for a busy weeknight. Try them over a bed of steamy rice or with toothpicks as an appetizer.",
